00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:52.650
You beasts no longer have any hope!

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:59.970
It's time to atone for acting on your violent instincts and destroying the universe!

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:04.140
This is for tranquility and order in the universe.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.910
Sonic!

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:21.180
Episode 76

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:21.180
Battle! Dark Oak

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.130
Sonic!

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.130
Calm down!

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.670
But Sonic is-

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:29.720
There's nothing we can do right now.

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:32.050
We have to regroup first!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.340
No! I'm going to rescue Sonic!

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.000
Amy!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.610
Sonic rescued you! Don't let that go to waste!

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.560
Sonic...

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:02.370
Chris... Knuckles...

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.630
We're sorry. We couldn't help Sonic.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.500
Sonic is fine!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:16.490
The hero who controls the Chaos Emeralds won't lose in a place like this.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:19.300
I'm certain that he'll come back.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.720
Right?

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.690
Yeah!

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:27.960
Yeah, that's right! He won't lose that easily!

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:31.420
Let's trust Sonic and do whatever we can!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:39.180
Ahem, this is Crimson Egg. Do you hear me?

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:43.200
I docked Crimson Egg with the Blue Typhoon.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.060
Whoa!

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.400
Did he miss us on purpose?

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.930
Most likely.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.240
He's playing around with you.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:06.870
Since he has Sonic, he's planning to plunge the rest of us into the depths of despair.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:08.750
He would go that far?

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:13.850
He's emitting a light signal that's creating forests across the universe.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.910
It may reach our planet soon.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:26.350
If forestation continues, there will be no creatures left in the galaxy.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:28.110
What a horrible thing to do!

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:30.080
Stop acting selfish!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.640
If there are only forests in the galaxy, that's no fun!

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:46.650
Dark Oak, do you hate other species that much?

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.020
Or...

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.940
Are you just angry for what my mother did to you?

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:14.260
Our weak attacks won't change anything!

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:17.120
If we charge him, he'll destroy us before we can get close!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.660
We don't have to waste!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.550
If we can just find a way to freeze him for an instant!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.910
All we have to do is zoom, boom and win!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.560
You keep your mouth shut!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:35.170
He's using the Chaos Emeralds to intensify the energy of the Planet Eggs that he gathered throughout the universe.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:39.830
This power allows the forest to spread indefinitely.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.120
What about the Master Emerald?

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:44.550
Knuckles, nice idea!

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:51.380
The Master Emerald's power might be able to suppress his Chaos Emeralds!

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.030
Yeah! That's the only way!

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:59.340
We'll use the Sonic Driver system to strike him with all of Master Emerald's energy!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.750
Good idea!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.180
No big deal.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.850
I admire your decision.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:11.780
You're willing to sacrifice the Master Emerald in order to save the universe.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.110
Sacrifice?

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:17.040
Because it will have to suppress a tremendous amount of energy.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:22.400
Even if the Master Emerald uses all of its energy, I don't know if that will be enough.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.650
What?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.340
Give it your best shot, but don't die.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:31.000
If the Master Emerald shatters, we'll help pick up the pieces.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.900
You can count on us! We're great at picking up and gathering things!

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:37.150
So let's break a gem and pick up its fragments!

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.160
Wait!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:43.470
If we lose the Master Emerald, how are we going to fire the Sonic Driver?

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:49.880
If we connect the Crimson Egg's engine to your cannon, it'll provide more than enough power.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:53.090
Great...

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:58.190
Nothing ventured, nothing gained. Your sacrifice will not go to waste.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.600
Shut up!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:04.780
I see... That gem may prove troublesome.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.780
Shadow!

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.330
Missiles, full burst!

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.320
I'm also firing the lasers!

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.730
Keep firing!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.580
We won't let you touch the Master Emerald!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.700
Don't underestimate our power!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.340
No underestimating!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:34.750
He and I are the last remaining members of our tribe.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:38.390
I was able to become friends with you, but why not him?

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:50.370
I've installed the Sonic Driver control program. All that's left to do is to connect the system.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:52.790
I'm ready on my side.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.270
Are you really okay with this?

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:01.370
How did you come to this universe?

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:08.800
I used the Master Emerald's energy pulse to synchronize our two worlds, allowing me to teleport.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.250
Just as I thought.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:17.980
You were able to come here because of the Master Emerald.

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:24.820
But there was an error, so the Master Emerald lost some of the teleportation data.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:27.030
That's why you became a kid.

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:30.590
It's a miracle that you didn't undergo any other changes.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.470
So that's why you're so small for an 18 year-old!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.460
What a klutz!

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:40.480
That's what you get for being reckless! You're still stupid for an 18 year-old!

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:41.820
Mind your own business!

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.200
Now, kid...

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:49.880
If we discharge Master Emerald's energy, your teleportation data will be completely gone.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:55.030
I don't know what will happen to the Master Emerald itself.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:58.300
It may take years to regenerate.

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:03.000
Either way, you can never return to Earth in your original form.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.080
If you overdo it, you may even die.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.310
Never again...

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:34.660
Connecting Crimson Egg's energy to the Sonic Driver...

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.610
Connected.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:41.710
If I go home without doing this, I know I'll regret it.

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:44.340
You didn't have to do it.

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:49.950
Everyone has given me so much, so now it's my turn!

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:55.980
There's nothing to worry about. Our galaxy is fun!

00:10:55.980 --> 00:11:01.990
Yeah! You should become Dr. Eggman apprentice and join the Eggman Empire's Cabinet!

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:05.780
Listen up! I'm your boss!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.370
You're my minion!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:08.070
Stop acting cocky!

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:11.640
You don't get to decide for me!

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:11.170
- Do you understand? Now call me boss!

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:19.140
Eggman, please don't tell anyone.

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:21.260
I promise.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:26.120
Crimson Egg and Sonic Driver bypass connection completed.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:30.920
Rewriting Sonic Driver's system to emit energy instead of firing missiles.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:32.770
Let's start.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:38.280
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:42.410
Chaos is power. Power comes from the heart.

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:47.620
Rouge!

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:52.940
Take this!

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.310
Everyone, retreat!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:19.440
The one who masters that also controls chaos.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:26.390
To the light that controls the power, protect us with your everlasting light!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:35.340
I'll give you my life! I'm counting on you, Master Emerald!

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:39.490
Please give us your power! Give us the power to protect everyone!

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.060
Master Emerald's energy is amplifying.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:45.110
90... 100... 120!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:05.560
Connecting energy from the Master Emerald to the cannon's hammer!

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:11.610
Trigger safety off! Targeting Metarex straight ahead!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.170
Maximum angle of elevation!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:03.780
Master Emerald, give us your strength!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.120
Fire Sonic Driver!

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.880
From the past to the future...

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.130
From one end of the universe to the other...

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:10.480
The same thing awaits all planets and creatures.

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:17.860
Beasts fight and devour each other. The plants wither, and the world ends.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.680
Eventually, a new species appears.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:29.290
But the same thing repeats.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:53.160
These are the memories of the planets.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:58.460
They're angry and sad memories because beasts killed them.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:00.950
I will fix the universe.

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:08.260
There will be no more destruction. The beautiful and silent world will last for eternity.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:28.060
Give up! What's the point of running in a world that has nothing but destruction?

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.000
You still have faith.

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:58.700
The memories from the beginning to the end of the universe are gathered here.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:02.380
They all contradict your hope.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.030
It's not the end.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.730
I can still run!

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:22.600
Controller of light, you also rely on force to get your way!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:27.350
You're a beast. We cannot coexist.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.470
Oh really?

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:33.500
Keep running forever in vain, hero of the beasts!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.700
No, I'm going home because everyone's waiting for me.

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:51.670
You're wrong. The world you want to return to is a labyrinth without an exit.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:57.610
Keep on running, Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:04.150
You're a pathetic hedgehog who's lost his freedom and is trapped by the world.

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:09.240
Keep going! You too!

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:51.630
He stopped!

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:57.240
The Chaos Emeralds are being suppressed, so the Planet Eggs inside his body are going berserk.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.720
We did it!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:14.950
Sonic!

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.430
Sonic!

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.860
Amy...

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:23.690
Sonic!

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.260
Amy!

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:52.310
I won't let you die here.

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:56.580
We're all going home to our planet.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.930
This is...

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:18.750
Our planet's Planet Egg!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.490
Sonic!

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:05.160
The Metarex is rapidly gaining energy!

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:13.730
Did you think this was enough to end our hatred and sadness?

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:18.730
I'm the one who can draw out the true power of the light of chaos!

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:44.800
He's disappearing.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:56.000
I will create a new universe that has no hate or sadness.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:01.410
He used hate and sadness to draw out the Chaos Emeralds' remaining power.

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:07.510
Dark Oak...

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:54.390
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:54.390
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:54.390
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

